# Markdown line wrap

When editing markdown prose in this repo:

- Match formatter width: wrap lines to **110 characters max**.
- Keep this in sync with `.prettierrc.yml` `printWidth: 110`.
- Keep this in sync with `biome.json` `lineWidth: 110`.
- Prefer natural sentence breaks; do not split inline code tokens.
- Keep tables when they improve human scanability or comparison.
- Do not force table-to-list conversion; decide format case by case.
